<div>
<div>
<h3>Awaken Your Power</h3>

<div>The rare, alchemical ingredients dropped by each of these rare beasts =
can be used to craft <strong>brand-new potions</strong> with their own form=
idable effects, introducing further new combat possibilities, while rare <s=
trong>Arcane Extracts </strong>can enchant potions to levels not seen befor=
e. And <strong>Awakened Items </strong>are coming, which can be <strong>imb=
ued with more powerful attributes </strong>through their use in combat, bec=
oming records of their own illustrious past. And while these risk being los=
t in combat, their <strong>unique traits </strong>live on, persisting throu=
gh Albion=E2=80=99s history as it is written.</div>
</div>
</div>
